## What We Are Building

Autonomous AI animation factory. This session: (1) finished the E25 "Sandy in the Airport-4" smoke, (2) fixed 5 factory defects the Director hit during the run, (3) reconciled a stale branch onto master, (4) ran a post-run efficiency + safety audit, (5) armed the code-side reconciler (auto-advance brain) for the next validation smoke.

North-Star: state-matrix → strong conductor (reconciler) → code muscles → thin agent → gates. The reconciler is the "conductor" — built 2026-07-04, kept OFF behind MECHANICS_AUTO_ADVANCE, never smoke-tested. This session ARMED it.

